# 🔄 2. UX FLOW (HOW USERS ACTUALLY MOVE)

This is the MOST important part.

---

## 🚀 STEP 1: USER ENTRY

```
Landing Page
   ↓
View Plans
   ↓
Register
   ↓
Login
```

---

## 💳 STEP 2: SUBSCRIPTION

```
Choose Plan (Basic / Premium / Pro / VIP)
   ↓
Select Duration (Daily / Weekly / Monthly / Yearly)
   ↓
Pay (UGX)
   ↓
Activate Account
```

---

## 📊 STEP 3: MAIN EXPERIENCE (CORE FLOW)

```
Dashboard Overview
   ↓
Filtered Games (based on plan)
   ↓
User selects games
   ↓
AI shows explanation ("why this game is selected")
   ↓
Confidence shown (🟢🟡🔴)
   ↓
User decides to follow picks
```

---

## 🧠 STEP 4: AI + TRUST FLOW

```
Game shown
   ↓
AI Explanation loads:
   - Why selected
   - Risk level
   - Market stability
   ↓
User trust increases
```

---

## 📈 STEP 5: PERFORMANCE FLOW (RETENTION ENGINE)

```
Matches finish
   ↓
System updates results
   ↓
ROI dashboard updates
   ↓
User sees:
   - Profit/Loss (UGX)
   - Win rate
   - Performance per plan
```

---

## 🔁 STEP 6: RETENTION LOOP

```
User checks ROI
   ↓
Sees profit or improvement
   ↓
Stays or upgrades plan
   ↓
Returns daily for new picks
```

